cripts/2020/11/14/li-auto-inc-li-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2020 Q4","e":"li","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lei Wang","x":"We have noticed that Tesla Motors and also BYD Han has been already using the LFP lithium ion batteries for cost saving.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/li-auto-inc-li-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2021 Q1","e":"li","d":"2021-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tim Hsiao","x":"With a 10,000 price hike, it'll be more than enough to offset the cost increase from the feature upgrade and raw material inflation and further again the second-quarter gross margin. [Foreign language]","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/li-auto-inc-li-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2021 Q1","e":"li","d":"2021-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Fei Fang","x":"Now you've raised prices in the phase lift, which is always very different from some of your competitors or other EV manufacturers who have lowered prices over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/li-auto-inc-li-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2021 Q2","e":"li","d":"2021-08-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Shen","x":"Very quickly, your first question besides the sales price increase of the new Li ONE from the cost perspective, primarily we had -- partially due to the BOM cost reduction from some of our suppliers, and also because of the sales volume increase, therefore, the amortization will reduce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/30/li-auto-inc-li-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2021 Q4","e":"li","d":"2022-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tim Hsiao","x":"And my second question is about the cost management because we expect the general inflation or price hikes of the batteries and other team materials to continue this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/25/li-auto-inc-li-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2022 Q1","e":"li","d":"2022-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Yanan Shen","x":"And also, as I just mentioned, the price increase already reflected our expectation of the -- for the raw material price in the coming quarters, yes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/10/li-auto-inc-li-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2022 Q1","e":"li","d":"2022-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Yanan Shen","x":"And at the same time, from the beginning of this quarter, we'll have a selling price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/10/li-auto-inc-li-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2022 Q1","e":"li","d":"2022-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Yanan Shen","x":"But of course, we'll always come back to our suppliers as for cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/10/li-auto-inc-li-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2023 Q2","e":"li","d":"2023-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Tim Hsiao","x":"So could you share with us the latest progress of the restructuring efforts?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/08/li-auto-li-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2023 Q2","e":"li","d":"2023-08-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jing Chang","x":"As Mr. Li Tie just mentioned, some total sectors on our vehicle gross margin in the second half of the year still maintain the guidance of 20% for the whole year balance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/08/li-auto-li-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LI 2023 Q3","e":"li","d":"2023-11-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Donghui Ma","x":"On the other hand, we will continue to invest in AI algorithms of autonomous driving as well as other cutting-edge technology.","url":"https: